  "limitations": [
    "All 16 HTTP allocation counts match. Observed median throughput changes range from -2.48% to +2.69%; exploratory paired intervals include zero. Positive medians are not a demonstrated speedup.",
    "Fast in-process OTLP cases saturate the default exporter queue and export about 2% of spans in both revisions. Their measurements do not establish lossless export performance. Live HTTP OTLP cases export 100%.",
    "The candidate uses the actual new published dependency graph, including some newer cloud and gRPC transitive dependencies. Differences cannot be attributed solely to framework code.",
    "Queue comparisons use an opaque two-field carrier and synchronous logical dispatch. They exclude framework W3C formatting/parsing, tracing span creation, and broker latency."
  ],
